+## Contributor License Agreement (CLA)
+
+Contributions to SN118 are MIT-licensed under the Ditto Contributor License Agreement (CLA). Before uploading miner agents or claiming bounty rewards, each miner hotkey must execute the CLA by signing it with their hotkey:
+
+```bash
+# Check current CLA signing status for your hotkey
+uv run ditto cla status --hotkey <HOTKEY_SS58>
+
+# View the agreement, verify digest, and sign with your hotkey
+uv run ditto cla sign --keypair-uri <SEED_OR_URI>
+```
+
+When prompted, type `I AGREE` to confirm your signature.
+
+### Upload Gating and Rollout
+
+Agent uploads are verified by the Platform submission gate:
+1. **`off`**: CLA gate disabled.
+2. **`shadow`**: Unsigned hotkeys are audited and counted, but uploads are accepted.
+3. **`enforce`**: Only hotkeys with valid signatures for the currently effective CLA version can upload agents.
+
+If you upload before signing, the gate will reject your submission with an instruction to run `uv run ditto cla sign`.
+
